#: data/com.github.marhkb.Pods.metainfo.xml.in.in:10
msgid ""
"Pods lets you manage your Podman and Docker containers, pods, images and "
"volumes, whether they run locally or on a remote machine."
msgstr ""

#: data/com.github.marhkb.Pods.metainfo.xml.in.in:11
msgid "With Pods you can, among other things:"
msgstr "Mit Pods kannst du unter anderem:"

#: data/com.github.marhkb.Pods.metainfo.xml.in.in:13
msgid "Connect to local and remote Podman/Docker instances."
msgstr "Zu lokalen und entfernten Podman–/Docker–Instanzen verbinden."

#: data/com.github.marhkb.Pods.metainfo.xml.in.in:14
msgid "Easily overview images, containers and pods."
msgstr "Einen einfachen Überblick über Images, Container und Pods erhalten."

#: data/com.github.marhkb.Pods.metainfo.xml.in.in:15
msgid "View prepared information about images, containers, and pods."
msgstr "Vorbereitete Informationen zu Images, Containern und Pods anzeigen."

#: data/com.github.marhkb.Pods.metainfo.xml.in.in:16
msgid "Inspect images, containers and pods."
